[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    25[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **The C API has no error-return channel at all.** `contrast_ratio` returns a
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    26[0m:[38;5;10m[49m bare `float`, takes both arguments **by value**, and cannot fail: there is no
