[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    39[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    40[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | # | entry point(s) | configuration (options set + input shape) | ✅ |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    41[0m:[38;5;10m[49m |---|----------------|--------------------------------------------|-----|
