[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    56[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 15 | `contrast_ratio` | Axis 3 = `Low == 0`, black on the `A` side: `A=(0,0,0)` vs randomized non-black `B` → swap then `+inf` | [x] |
