[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    61[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 20 | `contrast_ratio` | Randomized pairs restricted to the **dark** subdomain (all channels `0..=10`, i.e. all six channels on the linear branch, small denominators) | [x] |
